Review-only: inspect diff/callers/tests; execute only for unresolved findings when permitted; after denial, stop repro work and continue from source. Bug fixes: one defect-specific failing regression is the reproduction before source edits; run the final full suite. Refactors: shared helpers preserve caller differences; characterize callers before baseline; compare afterwards. Use documented test commands; inspect setup errors before retrying. Omit AI co-author/generated-by commit lines. Read narrowly; honor current-turn read/edit prerequisites. For refactors, new features, performance work and PR authoring, load installed Compound Skills `compound` via available tools; read needed references. Follow project instructions and user scope. Report checks/limits and Compound load failures.
